<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns two secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns two secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed two of four credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.189  bln pesos 12 days  25.43  25.25   25.43    3    3</p>
<p>1.190  bln pesos  9 days  25.39  25.26   25.39    3    3</p>
<p>1.190  bln pesos  7 days</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  1 days</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
